      "image": "assets/images/155945/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 1 tablespoon butter in a saucepan over medium-low heat. Add garlic; cook and stir until lightly browned, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ldNC6iPOdQRqgMY5UF5LoSrYgao=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-155945-lobster-dipping-sauce-DDMFS-step-02-f0deea046ce443b1884c7df8ddb00304.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155945/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining butter and reduce heat to low. Stir to melt butter, then mix in lemon juice, cilantro, and pepper. Let mixture steep over low heat for about 10 minutes.",
